{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJC3V1FFV31M89AZ5CC","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJC7Y2FXZPZ0D5NYGZB","name_zh":"城市護盾","name_en":"Urban Shield","alphabet":"U","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["天命族裔"],"explicit_sources":["天命族裔"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["天命族裔"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"城市","level":7,"note":"","kind":"class"}],"level_text_raw":"城市 7","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"防護系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語、姿勢、材料、法器","casting_time":"一個即時動作","range":"個人","target":"自己","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 輪/每等級","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"城市主動護衛你避免你受到傷害，保護你的可能會是牆壁、街燈柱或是其它構成物。\n你在面對所有的攻擊與法術時都能得到掩蔽（AC+4，反射檢定+2）。在你進行攻擊行動\n的在同一時間，城市會重新組成以配合你的行動，當你進行攻擊或施放法術時，你的敵人無法\n從牆壁、物體或其它城市的構成物得到掩蔽。\n你必須身處小城等級以上的社群才能施展此法術。\n材料成份：一塊碎石頭或碎磚塊。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1079,1079],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"e5f958e0d143e7c93d79dad8d741c3ee688cadda3ad180f768751a034590d2cc","heading":"城市護盾 （Urban Shield）（天命族裔）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
