{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJDFAHYFSVZWFMPBMR0","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJD993Z80SR6JWEDVSG","name_zh":"終極黑暗","name_en":"Utterdark","alphabet":"U","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["異怪書"],"explicit_sources":["異怪書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["異怪書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"術士/法師","level":9,"note":"","kind":"class"}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 9 級，晦暗 8 級法","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"咒法系","subschool":"創造","descriptors":["邪惡"],"components":"語言，姿勢，材料/法器","casting_time":"3 輪","range":"近距（25 尺+5 尺/2 每等級）","target":"","area":"100 尺/每等級半徑擴散","effect":"","duration":"1 小時/每等級","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"不可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"終極黑暗以你為中心蔓延開來，製造出一片冰冷刺骨、令人作嘔的魔法黑暗。這個黑暗\n類似深幽黑暗術所創造的黑暗，但是無法被魔法光明（儘管一個相等或更高等級的光明法術\n或類似效果可以在重疊區域暫時壓制終極黑暗，只要光明法術或效果持續，區域內就可以恢\n復正常照明。）\n更進一步，邪惡陣營的生物可以看透這片黑暗如同只是身處光線昏暗的環境。\n奧術施法材料：一根塗有類人生物血的 6 英尺長黑棍。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1080,1081],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"f336e69b0752273341a54543619167a1d11746693761ddff9d73c071258b3f0a","heading":"終極黑暗（Utterdark）（異怪書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
